Kael'thas asks for assistance!
You can use an Assist Ping on enemy Minions to signal that
you need help to collect the Regeneration Globe. While some
Heroes need them more than others, they are useful for all
Heroes, not just for who has a Quest requiring them.
This way a Hero with more mobility
or survivability than you can pick it up for you.
Regeneration Globes are needed for getting progress on the following Quests:
Circle of Life at Level 1 on Alexstrasza;
Regeneration Master at Level 1 on Anub'arak;
New Habits at Level 1 on Blaze;
Freshest Ingredients at Level 1 on Chen;
Tissue Regeneration at Level 1 on Dehaka;
Prog Rock at Level 1 on E.T.C.;
Chaotic Energy at Level 1 on Gul'dan;
Fingers of Frost at Level 1 on Jaina;
Laws of Hope at Level 1 on Johanna;
Mana Addict at Level 1 on Kael'thas;
Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad at Level 4 on Kel'Thuzad;
Catching Fire at Level 4 on Ragnaros;
Hunter-Gatherer at Level 4 on Rexxar;
Hungry for More at Level 1 on Stitches;
Viking Hoard as Baseline Quest on The Lost Vikings;
Ardent Restoration at Level 1 on Tyrael;
Vigor at Leve 1 on Valeera;
High King's Quest at Level 1 on Varian;
Give Me Twenty at Level 4 on Zarya;
Shadow Hunter at Level 1 on Zeratul.
The following Talents benefit from Regeneration Globes as well:
Lightwell at Level 1 on Anduin;
Glimmer of Hope at Level 7 on Auriel;
Devil's Due at Level 1 on Diablo;
Press Forward at Level 4 on Imperius;
Assimilation Mastery at Level 1 on Kerrigan;
Ossein Renewal at Level 1 on Leoric;
Power Hungry at Level 1 on Li-Ming;
Backup Battery at Level 7 on Mei;
Spite at Level 4 on Mephisto;
Is That a Health Pack?! at Level 4 on Tracer.
Due to Aspect of Death, Regeneration Globes
are also the only way for allied Heroes to heal Deathwing.
4 Regeneration Globes are almost equivalent to a Healing Fountain.

Kerrigan calls for retreat!
You can use a Retreat Ping nearby enemy Minions to communicate
that you wish your teammates to not kill them because you have
a Quest that requires last-hitting them. If you kill Minions
too quickly, you will slow down their Quest farming, delaying
their powerspike.
The following Quests require last-hitting Minions:
Globe of Annihilation on Azmodan;
Ravage's Baseline Quest on Kerrigan;
Voodoo Ritual on Nazeebo;
Ravenous Hunger at Level 7 on Orphea;
Sulfuras Hungers at Level 1 on Ragnaros;
Echo of the Elements at Level 1 on Thrall.
